<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login • Sambhav Security Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="badge">🔓 SQL Injection Playground</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/register">Register</a>
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <section class="form-card">
            <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">🚪 Login</h1>
            <p>Test weak authentication and SQL injection payloads on this intentionally vulnerable login form.</p>

            <% if (typeof message !== 'undefined' && message) { %>
                <div class="alert success"><%= message %></div>
            <% } %>

            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div class="alert error"><%= error %></div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/login" method="POST" class="grid">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="username">Username</label>
                    <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="admin' OR '1'='1" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="password">Password</label>
                    <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="password" required>
                </div>
                <button class="btn" type="submit">Sign In</button>
            </form>

            <p class="form-footnote">Need an account? <a href="/register">Register here</a></p>
        </section>

        <section class="alert" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <h3>🎯 CTF Hint</h3>
            <p>Bypass the login by injecting <code>' OR '1'='1</code> in the username field. Observe how the SQL query is constructed
                on the server for classic OWASP A03 exploitation.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
